<title>USA: Fortune Petroleum Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Fortune Petroleum Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss$0.02	   loss   $0.42</p>
<p> Net	   loss  278	   loss     4,151</p>
<p> Revs		 1,050		    1,010</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  11,551		    9,948</p>
<p>	     year</p>
<p> Shr	   loss$0.12	  loss    $0.90</p>
<p> Net	   loss   1,330	 loss   5,876</p>
<p> Revs		4,040		     3,143</p>
<p> Avg shrs	    11,351		   6,556</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fourth quarter of 1996 included a loss of $3.6 million from the sale of properties.</p>
<p>All 1995 results have been restated to reflect an accounting change.  As a result of the accounting change, net income for fiscal year 1995 decreased $0.3 million, or $0.05 per share, and net income for fiscal year 1996 decreased $2.0 million, or $0.18 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the average number of shares increased from the 1995 to the 1996 periods because of a private placement and the catching up of a weighted average started in June 1995.</p>
